      "content": "I'm looking into a zoning issue in Austin. We have a client trying to reclassify a parcel from R-1 (single-family residential) to a mixed-use designation, but we've run into some conflicting language in the municipal code. Specifically, there's a discrepancy between the setback requirements for new builds and the definitions regarding existing encroachments from adjacent properties. How should we approach reconciling these conflicting clauses to argue for the reclassification?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
